H:This tune appears cognate with a German / Swiss tune "Ach, ich bin so mude".
H:The tune was collected from Swiss sources by musicologist Hanny Christen.
H:It appears in the Traditional Tune Archive as "Slumber Polka". <https://tunearch.org/wiki/Slumber_Polka>
